	(text "Note:\nA reverse mount SMT LED or even a 3mm LED can be used instead of the SK6812.\nR3 can be used as a current limiter typically 2.2k or so.\nIn this case the GPIO sinks current from 3V3.\nYou may have to cut the GND trace to avoid shorting R3 to GND."
